  m_text: 'Hard Disk Drive (HDD): Slide drive into drive cage and secure tightly
    with mounting screws.

    Optical Drive: Insert drive through the front chassis
    bay and tighten retaining screws.

    Power Supply Unit (PSU): Position PSU
    in case compartment, align rear mounting holes, and tighten screws.

    Cable
    Connections: Connect 24-pin ATX, 4-pin 12V CPU, SATA power, SATA data, and front
    panel headers.

    Post-Assembly Verification: Attach peripherals (monitor,
    keyboard, mouse), power on, and press Delete / F2 / F12 to enter BIOS and confirm
    hardware recognition.'
