  m_text: PCFIX is an interactive, gamified web-based pre-laboratory application
    to transform technical training in computer hardware assembly and disassembly.
    By bridging traditional hardware servicing instruction with an engaging digital
    format, the platform offers students a risk-free, hands-on environment to practice
    component recognition, correct installation sequences, and troubleshooting procedures.
    Designed to improve technical skill retention and practical proficiency, PCFIX
    provides an accessible, step-by-step learning experience that prepares learners
    for real-world computer systems servicing
