  m_text: "\u2022\tTurn off the computer and unplug the power cable before opening
    the system unit.\r\n\u2022\tRemove all external connections before starting.\r\n\u2022\tUse
    proper ESD protection when handling computer components.\r\n\u2022\tHandle components
    carefully and hold them by their edges when possible.\r\n\u2022\tDo not force
    a component, cable, or connector.\r\n\u2022\tKeep screws and small parts in a
    safe container.\r\n\u2022\tKeep the work area clean, dry, and organized.\r\n"
